@landing-ui

GLOBAL CONTEXT for the Cellic landing page (reuse this for all sections):

Design:
- This landing page is built from 10 Canva sections, each exported as a separate image.
- Design images are stored under /design/sections:
  - 01.png
  - 02.png
  - 03.png
  - 04.png
  - 05.png
  - 06.png
  - 07.png
  - 08.png
  - 09.png
  - 10.png

Tech / files:
- Next.js App Router.
- Main page: app/landing-page/page.tsx
- Styling: Tailwind CSS only (no new SCSS).
- Typography system (MUST be reused everywhere)
  (these classes are defined in globals.css using Tailwind @apply with Montserrat.)

General rules:
- Full-width sections, content centered in a max-width container.
- Each section should visually match its design image as closely as practical on desktop.
- When I say "use the existing text styles", that means:
  - Section titles use .text-heading-2 (or the equivalent Tailwind utilities we defined).
  - Body copy uses .text-body.
- Only modify the section I mention by name (e.g. section 3: .landing__three-layer).
- No JavaScript or interactivity, layout with Tailwind utilities.
